## CS_NEWSTAR — Credit Suisse, "Project Osprey – Board of Directors discussion materials" (Nov-2017), 11×8.5 (letter), 20 pp

**Frame**: **red-outlined disclaimer banner across the very top** (thin dark red rectangle with small caps red text "CREDIT SUISSE DOES NOT PROVIDE ANY TAX ADVICE | MATERIALS ARE PRELIMINARY…") on every page. Title navy (#0B3B73) bold ~22 pt + **subtitle in light grey, same size, regular** ("Illustrative assumptions as of November 2017") — two-tone title/subtitle stack, subtitle gives scope/date not the so-what. Section numbering in a **navy filled circle "1" left of title** (tells which section you are in). Footer: thin navy rule, "Source:/Note:/(1)" block left in 7 pt, "Confidential" + page number right, © line.
Cover: grey (#D9DDE1) box in the middle-right with navy bold project name + grey subtitle + "Confidential / date", **steel-blue (#6A9BC0) bar under the box** — signature "grey card + blue underbar". Section dividers reuse it: "1. Summary of…" grey card with steel-blue underbar, right-aligned.

**Layout patterns**
- Text slides: bold intro paragraph (the framing question), then square-bullet list with en-dash sub-bullets; generous line spacing; no boxes.
- Table + "Selected commentary" (p4, p10, p12): left 70% = financial table (bold underlined section labels "Earnings before tax", rows of forecast / pro forma / **variance row italic bold on grey band**), right 30% = navy bold header "Selected commentary" with navy rule + 2–3 square bullets. Very consistent: **exhibit left, commentary right, both with a navy underline header**.
- **Red dashed rectangle highlighting a specific table row** (p13 "(–) Adjusted tax provision") + a matching red dashed note box under the table explaining the row ("Calculated based on adjusted GAAP earnings…"). = annotation-by-dashed-box. Total/variance rows on light steel-blue fill.
- Regression scatter (p5): header bold navy small "P/TBV vs. 2018E ROATCE / ROAE" + rule; scatter with light gridlines, markers by peer group (triangles/squares/circles, navy/teal/grey), regression line grey + **equation box (grey fill) "y = 0.1789x – 0.3646, R² = 0.699"**; subject company dot purple labelled; dashed-outline lavender callout boxes with arrows explaining implied values.
- Relative stock price (p7): lines (navy, purple, green) + grey volume bars on secondary axis; **mini returns table top-left** with the key column in **red dashed box**; event annotation grey box with red dashed border + red dashed vertical line at the date; end labels.
- Analyst estimates (p6): commentary on top, then compact table with bold primary-methodology row.
- Appendix financial summary (p18): dense 8 pt table, bold section labels on grey bands, key rows bold.
**Palette**: navy #0B3B73, steel blue #6A9BC0 / #A8C4DB (fills #DCE6F0), grey #D9DDE1, red only for disclaimer & dashed highlights. Font Helvetica/Arial. No icons, no images except logo. Square corners only.

