**Charts**: navy #0A1F5C bars for subject, **green #2CA02C for the second subject**, royal blue #0B6FD8 for peers; value labels above bars, light axis with values (BofA keeps value axis + tick labels, no gridlines); 2×2 grids of small bar charts each with bold black header (no rule) (p13). Line chart total return with **colored end-label tags (filled rectangles with white text: "GPP 63.9%")** stacked at right. Bars with outlined value labels.
**Typography**: Calibri/Calibri Light-like; body 11–12 pt; bold italic for lead-ins inside bullets ("*GPP is an expensive source of capital* – …"). Square bullets ■.
**Images**: none except logos (client, investors' logos panel). Cover artwork is abstract brand art, not a photo.
